/****************************************************************************
* GLBapi  - File loading routines
*----------------------------------------------------------------------------
* Copyright (C) 1992  Scott Hostynski All Rights Reserved
*----------------------------------------------------------------------------
*
* Created by:  Scott Host
* Date:        Aug, 1992
*
* CONTENTS: glbapi.c glbapi.h
*
* EXTERN MODULES - Main module of your program
*
* NOTES:
*
